@startuml
[*] --> Login Page
Login Page --> Main Dashboard : Successful Login
Main Dashboard --> User Profile Page : Navigate to Profile Page
User Profile Page --> View Profile List : Display Profile List
View Profile List --> View Profile Details : View Profile
View Profile Details --> Edit Profile : Edit Profile
View Profile Details --> Delete Profile : Delete Profile
View Profile List --> Create New Profile : Create New Profile
Edit Profile --> View Profile Details : Save Changes
Delete Profile --> View Profile List : Profile Deleted
Create New Profile --> View Profile List : Profile Created
Create New Profile --> View Profile Details : Profile Created
Main Dashboard --> [*] : Logout
User Profile Page --> Main Dashboard : Back to Dashboard
@enduml
